129:T10ff,**Sourcing Intelligence. Circular Supply.**\
Recyclate sourcing, material quality and material flow management for industry

Waldems, May 2026 – plastship will be present next week at **PRSE in Amsterdam and IFAT in Munich**.

#### We will be present as part of the network of our parent company RIGK GmbH:

Together with PACKLIANCE GmbH, Hannawald Plastik GmbH and our DAkkS-accredited PlastCert unit, we demonstrate **how circular economy solutions can be implemented in practice – in a compliant, predictable and economically viable way.**

#### Our Focus On Site How can recyclate quality become comparable – and therefore usable at an industrial scale?

## Focus Topic: Monitored Materials – Turning Recyclate Quality into a Market Factor

The use of recyclates rarely fails due to the material itself – but rather due to a lack of comparability and verifiable data. This is precisely where plastship comes in:

With **Monitored Materials**, we provide, for the first time, a structured, data-driven assessment of recyclate quality – across applications, material flows and over time.

**The result:**\
**▪️**Recyclers can objectively verify quality\
**▪️**Processors can use recyclates transparently\
**▪️**Decisions become technically and economically robust

![](/images/cms/plastship-siegel-quality-all-grades-colo-3470df.webp)

## Quality Certificate

**Data-Driven Assessment of Recyclate Quality**\
Material quality only becomes truly usable through structured data.\
By combining laboratory analyses, material flow information and continuous monitoring, we create a reliable basis for procurement and application decisions.

[Have your materials tested with us.](/recyclate-performance/)

![](/images/cms/screenshot-2026-04-28-115746-793fcf.webp)

## “We make recyclate quality the strongest argument.”

Rezyklateinsatz ist kein Einzelthema – sondern ein System.

> Our data-driven assessment creates a reliable foundation for the entire market: recyclers can prove the quality of their recyclates and use the evaluation as a basis for optimisation, while processors can transparently demonstrate to their customers that they are using high-quality recyclates.
>
> This forms the basis for decisions that are technically sound and commercially compelling.

— Andreas Bastian, Managing Director, plastship

## What We Will Showcase at the Trade Fairs

plastship connects data, material and market to deliver working solutions:\
**Recyclate sourcing:** structured procurement & stable supply concepts\
**Material quality:** data-driven assessment & comparability\
**Digital platform:** material search & decision support\
**Laboratory services:** analyses for secure material approvals\
**Material flow management:** access to qualified and stable input streams

**Objective:** not only to make recyclates available – but to make them reliably usable.

![](/images/cms/plastship-illustrations-1920x650px-netzw-a59e1b.webp)

## Your Tangible Benefits at plastship

Use the trade fairs to further develop your own material and sourcing strategies:

- On-site assessment of your recyclates & materials
- Evaluation of quality and suitability for use
- Exchange on specific applications and projects
- Development of supply concepts

## Book a Meeting & Test Your Materials

Would you like to have your recyclates assessed or discuss specific projects?

[**Secure your appointment in advance and request tickets – we will be pleased to invite you.**](https://www.rigk.de/en/rigk-at-ifat-prse-2026)

- Request your individual quality assessment
- Secure your trade fair ticket via us

## Driving the Circular Economy Forward Together

Both trade fairs in 2026 demonstrate:\
The market is evolving – moving away from isolated projects towards structured system solutions.

plastship provides the foundation:\
**Supply + Quality + Data + Material Flow**

#### For recyclates that are not only used – but that perform.

## Trade Fair Information

- **PRSE**\
  📍 Stand B18 | 📅 5–6 May 2026
- **IFAT**\
  📍 Hall A6, Stand 316 | 📅 4–7 May 2026

We look forward to welcoming you.

If you have questions or suggestions, please contact me!

**Mirco Gattinger**, Marketing & Social Media Manager\
